  "segments": [
    {
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3800,
      "text": "Unit 5. The power of plants."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 5280,
      "end_ms": 9280,
      "text": "Understanding ideas. Activity too."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 10740,
      "end_ms": 13940,
      "text": "Read the passage and check your answers."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 16080,
      "end_ms": 17340,
      "text": "Within a plant."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 19000,
      "end_ms": 20580,
      "text": "It's quarter past seven."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 21640,
      "end_ms": 25520,
      "text": "Here's worker number fifty-five in his green uniform."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 25520,
      "end_ms": 37940,
      "text": "He's going to start work in the plant. He works in workshop 1001 in the leaf. There are 20-100"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 37940,
      "end_ms": 46900,
      "text": "workers in each workshop. They collect sunlight and carbon dioxide during the day. Now workers"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 46900,
      "end_ms": 55200,
      "text": "from the root send up water. The water will rise up to the leaf through the stem. Then"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 55200,
      "end_ms": 60260,
      "text": "Then workers in the leaf will mix water, carbon dioxide and sunlight."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 61840,
      "end_ms": 62780,
      "text": "What are they going to produce?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 64160,
      "end_ms": 67980,
      "text": "Most importantly for them, there will be sugar."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 69060,
      "end_ms": 71660,
      "text": "It's useful for the growth of the plant."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 72700,
      "end_ms": 74840,
      "text": "Another product will be oxygen."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 75720,
      "end_ms": 77820,
      "text": "But the plant doesn't need much of it."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 78500,
      "end_ms": 81700,
      "text": "It means a lot to animals and humans though."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 82240,
      "end_ms": 83620,
      "text": "They need it to breathe."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 83620,
      "end_ms": 94060,
      "text": "The workers work hard. Soon it's going to get dark. They will take a rest. There are millions of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 94060,
      "end_ms": 103020,
      "text": "plants on earth. They give more than food and oxygen. Without plants the natural world would be very different."
    }
  ],
